<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Jan 11 totalled 136.149 million, versus a revised 135.723 million in the previous week and 134.642 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 168.492 million, versus a revised 170.593 million the previous week and 167.329 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
